  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia Civil Society I - Diakonia civil society</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia civila samh&#xe4;llet I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges st&#xf6;d till Diakonia initerades av ambassaden. Tanken var att n&#xe5; civisamh&#xe4;llet genom en svensk organisation med god kapacitet och kompetens inom demokrati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter (MR). Fokus i Uganda &#xe4;r fr&#xe4;mjande av MR, demokrati, j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, social och ekonomisk r&#xe4;ttvisa samt konflikthantering. Det tre&#xe5;riga st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r p&#xe5; 30 MSEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish support to Diakonia was an initiative of the Embassy to support CSOs in Uganda through Swedish Organisations with strong competences and capacity in the area of Democracy and Human rights promotion. Diakonias focus in Uganda is Promotion of Human Rights and Democracy, Gender Equity, Social Economic Justice &amp; Conflict management. The 3 year Swedish support is 30 MSEK</narrative>
  </description>
